// Generated by CMake from cmake/windows/gridline.rc.in: version information (from project() in
// CMakeLists.txt; the binary FILEVERSION / PRODUCTVERSION are numbers only, the strings carry the
// full version such as 0.7.0-beta.1) and the icon of a Windows executable.
#include <winver.h>

@GL_RC_ICON@

VS_VERSION_INFO VERSIONINFO
 FILEVERSION @PROJECT_VERSION_MAJOR@,@PROJECT_VERSION_MINOR@,@PROJECT_VERSION_PATCH@,0
 PRODUCTVERSION @PROJECT_VERSION_MAJOR@,@PROJECT_VERSION_MINOR@,@PROJECT_VERSION_PATCH@,0
 FILEFLAGSMASK 0x3fL
 FILEFLAGS 0x0L
 FILEOS VOS_NT_WINDOWS32
 FILETYPE @GL_RC_FILETYPE@
 FILESUBTYPE 0x0L
BEGIN
  BLOCK "StringFileInfo"
  BEGIN
    BLOCK "040904b0"
    BEGIN
      VALUE "CompanyName", "Gridline"
      VALUE "FileDescription", "@GL_RC_DESCRIPTION@"
      VALUE "FileVersion", "@GRIDLINE_VERSION_FULL@"
      VALUE "InternalName", "@GL_RC_NAME@"
      VALUE "OriginalFilename", "@GL_RC_FILENAME@"
      VALUE "ProductName", "Gridline"
      VALUE "ProductVersion", "@GRIDLINE_VERSION_FULL@"
      VALUE "LegalCopyright", "Gridline contributors"
    END
  END
  BLOCK "VarFileInfo"
  BEGIN
    VALUE "Translation", 0x409, 1200
  END
END
